      "options": {},
      "values": {
        "text": {
          "Text": "With Render 3D's Glow on, every ray that passes close to a surface without hitting it picks up Glow Color, more the closer and longer it grazes. Thin shapes on a dark ground show it best: a Box Frame turning round a Helix. Try the Glow port on Render 3D, and Glow Reach and Glow Color in its Light section."
        }
      },
      "width": 380.0
    },
